# n2 — the flight group (mirrors demos/11-noita/111-modifiers.bqn; shared by the -a and -b twins)
# Rows 1-3 spark bolts in flight (base damage 3, speed 6), row 4 a bomb bystander the cards never touch, row 0 the wand.
n 5
col keys num 0 1 2 3 4
col wand bool 1 0 0 0 0
col sparkBolt bool 0 1 1 1 0
col bomb bool 0 0 0 0 1
col damage num 0 3 3 3 8
col speed num 0 6 6 6 2
ja 杖 wand
ja 火花弾 sparkBolt
ja 爆弾 bomb
ja 損傷 damage
ja 速度 speed
